; WHO 4 thermoregulation: the zone setpoint write from 0400 up, the 5-digit and the short
; forms, on the zone (*#4*1*#14*TTTT*MODE##) and on the zone's control-unit form
; (*#4*#1*#14*TTTT*MODE##).
; Boundary probe of 2026-11-16 and 2026-11-17 on the 13 emulated gateways: the same 11 setpoint
; values with every mode 0..5 on both WHERE forms: 0400, 0401, 0404, 0405, 0434, 0435, 0500,
; 1000, the 5-digit 02500 and the short forms 50 and 250. The values up to 0351 are in
; thermo-setpoint-writes.
;
; Result (stock settings, two identical runs per target, 13 targets): per group below, the
; gateways that forward the frame to the bus or answer it on the event session, and the
; gateways whose daemon crashes. Gateways not named drop the frame.
;
; ORACLE ONLY: frames of this file crash a daemon on at least one emulated gateway; do not send
; them to a real gateway.

; 1. *#4*1*#14*N*N## (setpoint, mode)
;    dropped by every gateway
